### Key Technical Details
- Privilege system gates ~88 features via central `fy80` class
- Many features use `remaining` counter pattern (set to MAX_VALUE to unlock)
- Boolean gates can be forced to true/false as needed
- Expiration timestamps can be set to far future (0x7fffffffffffffffL)
- All patches must use `isMe()` guards where appropriate to avoid affecting other users
- xma wrapper pattern: use `string("privilege_name")` anchor, return FALSE (privilege active, not expired)
- Verification methods: patch to return true with `isMe()` guard

